{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選委會界別分組選舉投票結束，有超過5600名投票人投票，投票率超過98%。<br/>\n<br/>\n參選飲食界的蘭桂坊集團主席盛智文表示，今次選委會選舉幾乎所有席位都需要競爭，反映選舉更有認受性。<br/>\n<br/>\n被問到對下任行政長官的人選有何期望，盛智文回應說，對特首李家超沒有不滿意之處，認為如果他競逐連任是好事。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T12:43:49.876213+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T12:25:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T12:37:26.029502+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T12:37:26.029502+00:00","content_hash":"d12c49ab60136369705694bc965eaca577a4cb9753ce76dd7c44611c0680a878","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}